      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Excuse me, is this seat free?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Yes, go ahead. Are you going all the way to the coast?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Yes, to the last stop. First time there. Have you been?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Yes, I've been there a few times. Last summer I stayed for a week with my family."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Lucky you! What's it like?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "I love it. The beaches are beautiful, and the fish restaurants are amazing. But it gets really busy in August."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Good thing it's June, then!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Exactly. Are you going on vacation?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Not really. I'm meeting my fiancée's family for the first time, so I'm a bit nervous."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Oh, don't worry. I'm sure they'll like you. Just be yourself, and maybe bring them something sweet from the city."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Good idea! I'm going to get a coffee. Want anything?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "No, thanks, I'm fine. Good luck this weekend!"
    }
  ],
